    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="26.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 26.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ se ðe ofer ðis stalie, sece þæt he sece, þæt he næfre þæt feorh ne séce æt openre ðyfðe.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And he who steals after this—if the case is one of open theft—shall never save his life, whatever sanctuary he seeks.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ se ðe ofer þis stalige, gesece þæt he gesece, þæt he næfre þæt feorh ne gesece æt openre þyfðe.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
